   "Atlas/GroupTheory/ComplementOrbitFusion.lean:3:0: The module doc-string for a file should be the first command after the imports.\nPlease, add a module doc-string before `/-- Transitivity on the complement of a point, together with an element moving\nthat point, implies transitivity on the whole action. -/\ntheorem isPretransitive_of_complement_transitive {G X : Type*} [Group G] [MulAction G X] (a : X)\n    (hcomp : ∀ x y : X, x ≠ a → y ≠ a → ∃ g : G, g • x = y) (hmove : ∃ g : G, g • a ≠ a) :\n    MulAction.IsPretransitive G X := by\n  classical\n  obtain ⟨g, hg⟩ := hmove\n  have hr (x : X) : ∃ h : G, h • a = x := by\n    by_cases hx : x = a\n    · exact ⟨1, by simpa only [one_smul] using hx.symm⟩\n    · obtain ⟨h, hh⟩ := hcomp (g • a) x hg hx\n      exact ⟨h * g, by rw [mul_smul, hh]⟩\n  constructor\n  intro x y\n  obtain ⟨g, hg⟩ := hr x\n  obtain ⟨h, hh⟩ := hr y\n  exact ⟨h * g⁻¹, by rw [mul_smul, ← hg, inv_smul_smul, hh]⟩`.\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.style.header false`",
